<title>FINLAND: VIKING LINE NOV-JUL PASSENGERS UP 3.2 PCT.</title>
<headline>VIKING LINE NOV-JUL PASSENGERS UP 3.2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viking Line passenger volumes rose 3.2 percent in the November-July period to 3.61 million, the company said in statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
